eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VtqVuhE9ZSsQ7kNvwH_8XQ3&_nc_oc=Adk-yAcF1J5CM04mnd46VR3Y4e6AI-_IooKNJf48KW-2FpC9UFatE1fWcsB6reZpddw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvqF36GetARXyr0_BeEH_QDhBMAh7hbZ4K4nIidoOLaGg&oe=699AF5CD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2HIFVQIlGIkQ7kNvwGPoAGw&_nc_oc=Adn9Gbc_Bj0z-Nh-XG7zW6vYrpCmDZ3IpYGqJbOrRqXWtEgyVuNOwyz95GXNTmepKPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv0mi7F24yNf2d6I3SYpwTvJnQlNppscxmCIy625-ftQQ&oe=699AE82C"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zS0dJKzUa3IQ7kNvwF0vlvN&_nc_oc=AdmBCpJdkqutoHpW5DRE8VTqpPPYgqBApjEjyIuKhet14QQX8NppeHgbMWYIPmw5dhk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7aFKxzFl8qyczIDS6j-VQl_tjr9JlsZbEHz31k7Ex0A&oe=699B09BD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eGintA3HPmQQ7